            "created_at": "2025-07-16T05:43:04.601249+00:00",
            "notes": "First round I take Ability Power, Weapon Power and Attack Speed to get the most damage and pick potential (money!) possible. I always take Legendary Loadout as this maximizes our pick potential. I don't like lifesteal especially early as hitting a full barrage of rockets will only heal you around 25 HP at this point. I also don't like extra armor because 25 armor is not beneficial for DVa compared to on a squishy character.\n\nThe offensive stats are more useful here because your goal is to one shot squishies with one barrage of missiles plus cannon follow up if needed. \n\nThe playstyle doesn't vary too much round to round, just look for isolated squishies and try to ignore the enemy tank as much as possible. Whatever you do don't get stuck fighting the enemy tank straight up in the choke, because Dva loses to pretty much every other stadium tank in straight up brawl fights.",
