            "notes": "The goal is to buy Onslaught Ordinance as fast as possible, even if its your only item in round 2. This is by far the biggest damage spike for your rockets (even more than having Nano Cola + Multi Tool + 10 AP which is around the same price). If you can't afford it after round 1, get Nano Cola + whatever else you can afford from the optional items.\n\nKeep playing the same way, looking for isolated squishies and one shotting them. Always target supports first if possible but if someone immobile like Cass or Ashe is isolated, they are an easy target as well because you can eat all of their self peel with matrix.",
