            "created_at": "2025-07-16T05:43:04.601249+00:00",
            "notes": "Our second power should always be Overstocked. This plus Onslaught Ordinance already massively increases our raw damage and allows us to kill one if not two enemy squishies with ease. You can get easy picks without much commitment, and from a decent distance, if you can find an off-angle on enemies going through a choke and fire your barrage of missiles where their tank cannot protect them. \n\nYou probably don't want a second purple at this point unless you are way ahead and can afford it plus Nano Cola. If not, just take Nano Cola and Multi Tool/Custom Stock or whatever greens you can afford. \n\nPersonally, I ignore all blues that aren't Nano Cola/Multi Tool/Custom Stock and all greens that dont give Ability Power or Weapon Power at this stage.",
