            "created_at": "2025-07-16T05:43:04.601249+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 4 is when you should get your second purple, and what you go for depends on enemy team comp. \nCybervenom is good against everything because antiheal has massive value and is easy to hit on the entire enemy team with your splash damage. However, vs certain heroes like Soldier.76, Lucio, Reinhardt or Junker Queen, the slow of Liquid Nitrogen is also very useful (I would still take antiheal first vs Queen, but its up to you). \nIf the enemy team has a low healing support duo, like Lucio/Zen, you can also take Superflexor for raw AP. D.Va basically has full uptime on this item, so its 25% AP and 10% WP for a relatively low cost.",
